        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "bfa42274c228.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_cat02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "35fff10c7d9a.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/b/8/b890e730.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "美味しいカレーを食べました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我吃了超好吃的咖喱。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I had some delicious curry."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "バターチキンカレーです"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是黄油鸡肉咖喱哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It was butter chicken curry"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "22d4d7823f10.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_pikapika.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "人生初マンゴーラッシーも飲みました。両方とっても美味しかったです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还喝了人生第一杯芒果拉西，两种都特别好喝。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I also had my first mango lassi ever. Both were really delicious."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "レコーディング中は喉のことを考えて刺激的な食べ物を避けていたので、余計に美味しく感じてしまったのかもですね！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "录音期间为了嗓子着想一直避开刺激性的食物，所以可能正因为如此才觉得格外美味吧！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "During recording I avoided spicy and stimulating food out of concern for my throat, so maybe that's why they tasted even better! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さてさて、本題に……"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好了好了，进入正题……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now then, on to the main topic..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "88f9715b680c.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_chick.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "先日、特典やお渡し会イベントの詳細をお知らせしたところ質問をいただきましたのでブログにてお答えさせていただこうと思います。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "前几天公布了特典和亲手递交会活动的详情后，收到了大家的提问，所以想在这里借博客来回答一下。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After I announced the details of the bonuses and the hand-out events the other day, I received some questions, so I'd like to answer them here on the blog."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "「イベント参加券は対象店舗以外で予約してももらえないの？」"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“活动参加券不是在指定店铺以外的地方预订就拿不到吗？”"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"If I reserve at a store that isn't a participating store, can't I get the event ticket?\""
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "「答えは……YES!! もらえません」"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“答案是……YES!! 就是拿不到。”"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"The answer is... YES!! You can't get one\""
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "※絵本付生産限定盤のみイベント参加券がついてきます。ご注意ください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "※只有附带绘本的生产限定盘才会附送活动参加券，请注意。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Note: Only the limited edition with the picture book comes with an event ticket. Please be careful."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
